BUG CONFIRMED: with the DMI still LOCKED (dmi_unlocked_reg_wr_en=0) and the TAP
addressing SS_DEBUG_INTENT, the patched expression asserts we=1 (write succeeds)
while the correct/upstream expression asserts we=0 (write should be blocked).
An unauthenticated party on the DMI/JTAG TAP can set the debug-intent strap
without ever completing the DMI unlock/authentication sequence.
